{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测 Windows 安全事件中的用户账号创建。对应需求：新建账号。环境若更关注 4720 基线，可并用【自定义】Windows用户账号创建。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows用户账号创建","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n目录或本地出现新用户账号。\n\n### 为何重要\n新建账号是常见持久化。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 确认操作者、目标用户名与时间。\n2. 是否立即加入高权限组。\n3. 关联首次登录源地址。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用对应数据源（Elastic Defend / System / Windows / auditd，按规则说明）。\n2. 机器学习规则需关联 ML job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"1aa9181a-492b-4c01-8b16-fa0735786b2b","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","对应需求: 新建账号"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  (process.name : (\"net.exe\", \"net1.exe\") and not process.parent.name : \"net.exe\") and\n  (process.args : \"user\" and process.args : (\"/ad\", \"/add\"))\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1136","name":"Create Account","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1136/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1136.001","name":"Local Account","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1136/001/"},{"id":"T1136.002","name":"Domain Account","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1136/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}}],"false_positives":["自动化开户与软件安装"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","winlog.computer_name","user.name","user.id","source.ip","event.code","winlog.event_id","event.action","event.outcome","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","winlog.event_data.SubjectUserName","message","event.original"]},"version":318,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
